"text": "Paste any token on Arc, Robinhood Chain or Solana. The scanner reads who really controls it, tries sells at three sizes, checks where it trades and who holds it — then sums it up in one score, with critical flags and how sure it is. It reads the chain; it can't promise a token is safe."
