"text": "It has no withdraw function. ETH leaves only to buy an NFT through Seaport, and the purchase reverts unless the NFT arrives in the vault in the same transaction. It only buys collections the team has listed, under each collection's price cap. A new collection (or a higher cap) waits 24 hours before it can be bought, so everyone sees it first. NFTs leave only through a settled raffle, to the winning wallet. NFTs of listed collections sent to the vault become prizes too."
