"page": "ArcPad and utilities",
"title": "Who can win",
"url": "/arc",
"text": "Every $ARCIRCLE wallet on Arc with at least 1,000 $ARCIRCLE (held plus locked). Your weight is your wallet balance (ArcLock locks count) plus your $ARCIRCLE locked in ARCIRCLE Staking plus your veARCIRCLE, so locking in ARCIRCLE Staking raises your odds and a max lock counts double. Contracts, burn addresses and team wallets are left out. The NFT is sent on Robinhood Chain to the same address that holds your $ARCIRCLE on Arc — the same wallet works on both chains."
